<concept id="d210aA" xml:lang="en">
   <title>Matrix Filters</title>
   <prolog>
      <author>Rakesh Singh</author>
      <critdates>
         <created date="Oct 29, 2018"/>
      </critdates>
      <metadata>
         <prodinfo>
            <prodname>X-Author for Excel</prodname>
         </prodinfo>
      </metadata>
   </prolog>
   <conbody>
      <p>Matrix data is filtered based on the Query action and the Search or Select action. To display any of these filters, the fields must be mapped outside the matrix (usually above the matrix).</p>
   </conbody>
</concept>
